# Google Maps Platform API Key for Vue 3 + Vite + TypeScript
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and replace the placeholder with your key.
#
# Quickstart with a free zero-billing Maps Demo Key (prototyping only):
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card required) and accept the Demo Project Terms.
# 3. Click to generate/reveal your Maps Demo Key and paste it below.
#
# For production, create and restrict an API key in Google Cloud Console:
# https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API, and Roads API.

VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
